{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0173_1000_p", "source_sha256": "52b3fff3ada561249029afffae830f4fbed5af5be93208d866b3685df68f4eab", "ja": "（ミリオンパークの式典イベントは、大成功だった。\nあれから、取材がいろいろ来ているらしい……）", "zh": "（Million Park的典礼活动大获成功。听说从那以后，陆续来了不少采访……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0173_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "4854d52a388b346e82e51ca9f9542ad7d083ad1ff9289a0ddd414ed63fcb4ae8", "ja": "お疲れさま、{$P$}。\nコーヒーで一息つかない？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n要不要喝杯咖啡歇一会儿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0173_1002_p", "source_sha256": "90216eb7ef9c0672454cf32ae33e21ba687f6f359a0300f8dbb1a6d48a3ec30f", "ja": "このみさん！　ありがとうございます。\nちょうど休憩しようと思ってたんです。", "zh": "木实，谢谢你！我正好想休息一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0173_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "ad3b31bf7e5bc9dc7dc1649b70ed9427ea9a93c301b7bbeeed7cd1874b48ec5c", "ja": "そんな気がしたの。\nちょうどいいタイミングだったみたいね？", "zh": "我就有这种感觉。\n看来时机正好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0173_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e64d1cd15223208bf2b146d645809dd602333ee4c0db5d6f97a88c215d135ffc", "ja": "そういえば、ミリオンパークの特集記事を見ましたか？\n確か雑誌がここに……あ、これです。", "zh": "说起来，您看过百万公园的专题报道吗？\n我记得杂志就在这里……啊，就是这本。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0173_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "5211d7adcd4e6773d14d43259b17fef1c42ec79c042f248629bcc9af8938aef9", "ja": "あら、この前のイベントを紹介した記事ね！\nみんな、楽しそうな顔してるじゃない。フフッ。", "zh": "哎呀，是介绍上次活动的报道呢！\n大家看起来都好开心嘛。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0173_1006_p", "source_sha256": "00d9e1a663b32ddfb3a4d3eb8bdc2a7cb659918c3be6106e3d6634b46c7878ee", "ja": "式典の後も、ミリオンパークは大盛況みたいですね。\nこのみさん達のCMも好評で、続投の話も出てますよ。", "zh": "典礼结束后，百万乐园也一直非常热闹呢。\n木实小姐你们拍的广告反响也很好，甚至还提到了续约的事哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0173_1007_p", "source_sha256": "52285186a60bb2ba99b3b6fca610f6734f1aedd855f8ded368837cc9f1eba3f3", "ja": "今回の仕事が成功したのは、このみさんが率先して、\nみんなをまとめてくれたおかげですね。", "zh": "这次的工作能够成功，多亏了这个美带头把大家团结了起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0173_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "127dd76a4cb5acd297985f56d2d65edc3963f8ea02443a1f6f2ff6ac5331fc64", "ja": "大げさよ、{$P$}。\n私は、みんなのお姉さんだもの。これくらい当然よ！", "zh": "太夸张啦，{$P$}。\n我可是大家的大姐姐，这点事理所当然啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0173_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "312a60b4ae3737af848bc650297293f3aaca41bfd9c752e2d674d182a23ce85c", "ja": "{$P$}こそ、\nもっとお姉さんを頼ってくれていいのよ。なんて♪", "zh": "正是{$P$}，\n你尽可以多依靠姐姐一些哦。开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0173_1010_p", "source_sha256": "eb38ee471fd4f7c10b37363e8183a2b311859978903b6542514faaf8a62a6b26", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\nその時がきたら、ぜひ頼らせてもらいます。", "zh": "谢谢你。\n到那个时候，我一定会好好依靠你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0173_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "5a344d8cf78f5170dd51fbea7070b47fbf3d046fff2cb31f439c50616fa419b9", "ja": "ええ、楽しみにして……あら？", "zh": "嗯，我会期待着……哎呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0173_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3ae563d401510c89e64ef36e736fa333ed63c370ef668eb12d0e60ea4630db61", "ja": "どうかしましたか？", "zh": "有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0173_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "e52b656ea85e991948a55313c127d08af0d8c1a36d7a5cd84c0a94793d88690c", "ja": "ねえ……机の上のコレは何？\n書類が山どころか、タワーになってない？", "zh": "喂……桌上这是什么？\n这些文件别说堆成山了，都快成塔了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0173_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ac7dd2aa6cd08ffeade9ca9445351c6de2702486b19fc98b0ec9c1d0876e7863", "ja": "その……最近、片付ける時間がなくて、つい……。", "zh": "那个……最近实在没时间整理，不知不觉就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0173_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "32fcff0e3875ddf4292c179c954e412f3c472529eba927ea885d50abc83510ab", "ja": "つい、じゃないでしょ！\nぶつかって崩れたら、危ないじゃないの。もう！", "zh": "这可不是一句“不小心”就算了！\n要是撞上去弄塌了，多危险啊。真是的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0173_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "3f0a8978d6273704469ce02c42d3333aafc457b64a19f3ffade66819f6d56620", "ja": "はあ……仕方ないわね。\nここは、このみお姉さんの出番かしら？", "zh": "唉……真拿你没办法。\n看来该轮到这个美姐姐出场了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0173_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "410352455db64e6bf2a686e390efdb8bcd73f9c1dbdc7489a4e45d8b340a3f10", "ja": "コーヒーを飲み終わったら、片付けちゃいましょ！\nお姉さんにまかせなさいっ、ウフフッ♪", "zh": "喝完咖啡后，我们把东西收拾一下吧！交给姐姐我就好啦，呜呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
